          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: مستقبل",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مستقبل — mustaqbil — \"the future\". Urdu's future adds گا, گی or گے to the verb's -ūṅ form: میں پڑھوں گا۔ — maiṅ paṛhūṅgā — \"I will read.\" A woman says پڑھوں گی, paṛhūṅgī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for this chapter."
